        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inexplicable portal has appeared, devouring the surrounding plants and trees. Countless infected skeletons and monsters pour out of the portal, their target being the &quot;Guardian Stone Tablet&quot; on the island. Once the stone tablet is destroyed, the entire island will be completely shrouded in plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, the plague has eroded several islands and is continuing to spread outward. At this moment, a distress signal comes from a border village: the plague portal has opened, and infected creatures may invade at any time. The Guardian Stone Tablet in the village needs your protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a magic tower defender on the island, using a bow and arrow as well as a magical sand table to fend off enemy invasions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/d9c875db036901c27b68c1034e09c6c9.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=342 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The six core highlights of <i>Divine Archer Tower Defense</i> will take you into a fantasy world where strategy and action intertwine:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Magical Sand Table: Intertwining Virtual and Real</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a mysterious strategic sand table. Every layout and deduction you make here can be mapped in real time and affect the in-game world ahead, as if you possess the magic to manipulate reality. Players can place defense towers on the magical sand table, which corresponds to the in-game map on a 1:1 scale. At the same time, identical defense towers will rise in the real-world scene corresponding to the sand table, and you can use various defense towers to block the enemy's attack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/686fc5891707ad5a2bedb4d16d82d9f4.poster.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/686fc5891707ad5a2bedb4d16d82d9f4.webm?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/686fc5891707ad5a2bedb4d16d82d9f4.mp4?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Dual-Front Combat: Stirring Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You not only need to make overall plans and carefully arrange various arrow towers and fortifications; you can also personally draw the bow and shoot arrows, resolving crises with precise shots, and enjoying the dual fun of strategic layout and action operations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/4c0733b0a80bbda4e519762f4fc2185f.poster.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/4c0733b0a80bbda4e519762f4fc2185f.webm?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/4c0733b0a80bbda4e519762f4fc2185f.mp4?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Power of Creation: Crafted by You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From editing the map with every blade of grass and every tree to designing the level events wave by wave, powerful creation tools are in your hands. Create a unique battlefield and invite friends to challenge your masterpiece. The desktop version of the game allows players to customize maps and levels, letting you build a battlefield of your own. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/e1591cad34f96d975042cd7700996571.poster.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/e1591cad34f96d975042cd7700996571.webm?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/e1591cad34f96d975042cd7700996571.mp4?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Multi-Platform Immersion: Seamless Cross-Border Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports two gameplay modes: traditional PC desktop and VR. This allows you to either make strategies in a comfortable setting or step into the battlefield as if you were really there, fully experiencing the thrill of defending and drawing the bow to shoot arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/c8593f8aab980a5172b9831b9bdb4841.poster.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/c8593f8aab980a5172b9831b9bdb4841.webm?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/c8593f8aab980a5172b9831b9bdb4841.mp4?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Free Shooting Range: Do as You Wish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shooting range is not only a training camp for honing your archery skills and testing new weapons, but also a safe space where you can move freely, explore, and discover surprises—providing a place to relax amid the intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/fcd97b1657fbdb39d4827a9a4cf4d5be.poster.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/fcd97b1657fbdb39d4827a9a4cf4d5be.webm?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/fcd97b1657fbdb39d4827a9a4cf4d5be.mp4?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Player Command Room: Masterminding Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your strategic core! Here, you can not only configure and upgrade equipment and weapons, and purchase scarce resources, but also move freely. The achievement trophies unlocked in the game will be displayed here, recording your gaming career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/fce8f13a1515722e77b90f442709c0fd.poster.avif?t=1788518204\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/fce8f13a1515722e77b90f442709c0fd.webm?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954300/extras/fce8f13a1515722e77b90f442709c0fd.mp4?t=1788518204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
